  "title": "Solid Gold Pie",
  "description": "The solid gold in this pie 's pastry shell is a simple, delicious custard made from a little bit of vinegar, a couple of eggs, a heap of sugar, a splash of vanilla and some melted butter. For even more gold, consider sprinkling in some golden raisins or butterscotch chips.",
